; Ar. proton-18. period 3, group 18 noble gas. valence: 0.
; most abundant noble gas on earth (0.93% of atmosphere).
; chemically inert. used as inert atmosphere in welding, incandescent bulbs.
; argon-potassium dating: K-40 decays to Ar-40 (half-life 1.25 billion years).
; used in plasma cutting, laser technology, semiconductor manufacturing.
; slightly denser than air — sinks to low points.

